# ws079-p012: two fingers down, a short swipe up together, one lifts, the
# other moves while a new finger touches, a third finger in a frame of three
# (split over two reports of two fingers: a "hybrid" USB touch screen), and
# all three lift together.  The fingers lie in 0..1000.
size 1000 1000 2
# The reader opens the node meanwhile.
wait 1500
down 1 100 800; down 2 300 800
swipe 0 -100 2 50
up 1
down 3 500 500; move 2 320 700
down 4 600 600
up 2; up 3; up 4
hold 300
